data: {"id": "782982b2d8c54f9f-final", "run_id": "782982b2d8c54f9f", "seq": 1676, "ts_ms": 1788802374616, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_terminated_reason: `OOMKilled` | 确认内存超限被杀 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory: `64Mi` | 确定内存硬性限制 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container app` | 现象确认，确认 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.last_exit_code: `137` | 佐证 OOMKilled (退出码 137) |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | container_memory_working_set_bytes (app) 当前值 `30171136` bytes (~28.7 MiB) | 容器当前运行内存，低于限制但波动大 |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Log Pattern: `memory allocation advanced` on `/work`, allocated_mib: `10` -> `46` | 证明应用通过 `/work` 请求持续增长内存分配 |\n| 7 | Tracing | Deepflow | 等价 HTTP Flow: `GET /work` 返回 `200`, src_ip: `172.16.104.47` -> dst_ip: `172.16.104.42` | 追踪到导致内存增长的客户端入口 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 的 `OOMKilled` 与退出码 `137`（证据 #1, #4）直接印证了硬限制 `64Mi`（证据 #2）被突破。Logging 揭示了内存增长的具体机制：在 `/work` 接口请求中，内存分配量从 `10 MiB` 激增至 `46 MiB`（证据 #6），结合 Tracing 确认了外部请求入口（证据 #7）。Metric 数据（证据 #5）显示在崩溃周期内容器内存实际值曾接近或达到 64 MiB 限制（如历史峰值 39 MiB 以上及多次崩溃前的波动），且采样点跨度表明内存并非恒定，而是随请求动态累积直至触顶。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用内存限制设低 (64Mi) → 持续分配内存 (单次请求分配量 10Mi-46Mi) → 突破硬性限制触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → Kubelet 重启容器失败导致 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因是 **容器内存限制配置过低**。\n\n证据表明，应用 `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` 的 `memory.limit` 被硬限制为 `64Mi`（证据 #2）。应用在处理 `/work` 请求时存在持续的内存增长行为，日志显示单次操作内内存分配量从 `10 MiB` 跃升至 `46 MiB`（证据 #6），这一增长趋势极易导致内存消耗触及或超过 `64Mi` 的物理天花板。一旦突破限制，Linux OOM Killer 立即终止进程，产生退出码 `137` 并记录为 `OOMKilled`（证据 #1, #4）。由于该应用被设计为长期运行的服务，这种随请求不断累积直至崩溃的模式导致容器反复重启，最终呈现为 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（证据 #3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 122.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 122.5s (Evidence 113.1s, RCA 9.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 157.101, "metrics": {"run_id": "782982b2d8c54f9f", "mttr": {"value": "2.6m", "seconds": 157.10852646827698, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 157108.52646827698, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 93435.91284751892, "tool_calls": 22, "executed_tool_calls": 20, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 22, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 176099.33161735535, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 63145.97415924072}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22519.654989242554, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 122494.304895401, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12073.635578155518, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

